A(!isFinite(d4.state().plateLife) && d4.state().plateKeep === true && d4.state().serveWindow === 4.5,
  "盘上永久保鲜：plateLife = Infinity（无倒计时）/ plateKeep = true；锅内窗口常量仍是 4.5（兼容层）",
  "plateLife=" + d4.state().plateLife + " plateKeep=" + d4.state().plateKeep);

